&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable track record of dealing well with ambiguity, prioritizing needs, and delivering results&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
