&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to safety protocols, cleanroom standards, and regulatory compliance during operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support the development of training materials for team members on equipment operation, safety protocols, and process procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Train and mentor junior team members on equipment operation, safety, and best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
