&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO, vacation, sick time, and holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay via direct deposit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your Impact as RN Clinical Manager&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;In this leadership role, you will oversee clinical operations, mentor field clinicians, and ensure exceptional patient care and regulatory compliance across the home health team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities Include:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing clinical leadership and support to nurses and therapists in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing OASIS documentation and ensuring Medicare compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing care plans (485s) and clinical documentation workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting onboarding, training, coaching, and performance development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as a clinical resource for triage and patient care guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving quality outcomes and best practices across the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Registered Nurse (RN) license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years of nursing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recent Home Health experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on OASIS experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Medicare regulations and clinical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership, communication, and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Grow Your Leadership Career with BAYADA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you’re passionate about patient-centered home health care and ready to lead a team that delivers exceptional outcomes, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Join BAYADA and take the next step in your nursing leadership journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Apply today to learn more.&lt;/h3&gt;
