&lt;li&gt;Ambulation / Transfers / mechanical lift devices / range of motion exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vital sign checks: temperature, pulse, respiration&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home management: laundry, meal preparation, bed making, etc.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medication assistance&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have questions? Click the APPLY NOW button and a BAYADA representative will reach out ASAP to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
