&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Note to Colorado applicants: applications will be accepted and reviewed on a rolling basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please note that this role is not available to candidates in Illinois, California, New York, New Jersey, and Hawaii.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Based on the nature of this role, you will need to complete several state background checks for clearance to see clients. Florida requires a fingerprint based background check, with more information found &lt;a class=&quot;in-cell-link&quot; href=&quot;https://info.flclearinghouse.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Please note that the cost for this background check will be paid for in full by Charlie Health.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-REM&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
